    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API for the Python script. I will need to use the `google-cloud-translate` library to interface with it and ensure that the script clearly identifies this dependency. I am now evaluating the best approach to integrate the API calls into the `translate_text.py` file.\n\n\n**Implementing the Framework**\n\nNow, I'm fully committed to using the Google Cloud Translation API via the `google-cloud-translate` library in `translate_text.py`. The plan is to build the Python script to use the translation library. The key parts will be to import `google.cloud.translate_v3` and initialize the client to call translate functions.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819372220,
          "start": 1789819370822
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98c3d460015W0tmx7nAcPXlX",
      "message_id": "msg_0b98c334a001L6JjiuAwSfYpLR",
      "session_id": "ses_f4673cd3bffez6jNUWDAF1SE96",
      "time_created": 1789819370822,
      "time_updated": 1789819372221
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "G4Et0NsEdGdYNiMx",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import translate_v3 as translate\n\ndef translate_text(\n    text: str,\n    target_language: str,\n    project_id: str\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Translates text into the target language.\n\n    Args:\n        text: The text to translate.\n        target_language: The language to translate to (e.g., \"es\" for Spanish).\n        project_id: The Google Cloud project ID.\n\n    Returns:\n        The translated text.\n    \"\"\"\n    client = translate.TranslationServiceClient()\n    parent = f\"projects/{project_id}/locations/global\"\n\n    response = client.translate_text(\n        request={\n            \"parent\": parent,\n            \"contents\": [text],\n            \"target_language_code\": target_language,\n        }\n    )\n\n    translated_text = \"\"\n    for translation in response.translations:\n        translated_text += translation.translated_text\n    return translated_text\n",
            "filePath": "translate_text.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "diagnostics": {},
            "exists": false,
            "filepath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-sgo0e4oz/translate_text.py",
